          "issue": "The theological metadata cites a project-policy entry for “elect” that does not exist in the supplied current contested-terms table. The accompanying claim that this rendering aligns with a project default is therefore not supported by the supplied policy. This does not make “God’s elect” an inaccurate translation.",
